freecad_source_1.1.1.tar.gz"}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/releases/assets/396546887", "id": 396546887, "node_id": "RA_kwDOAFeGkM4XotNH", "name": "freecad_source_1.1.1.tar.gz-SHA256.txt", "label": "", "uploader": {"login": "github-actions[bot]", "id": 41898282, "node_id": "MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D", "html_url": "https://github.com/apps/github-actions", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events", "type": "Bot", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "content_type": "text/plain; charset=utf-8", "state": "uploaded", "size": 94, "digest": "sha256:f688f6dd22016cd1af1408999f9393614cc94e97e0c96b8d24a3e43b266daef1", "download_count": 329, "created_at": "2026-04-14T22:54:31Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-14T22:54:31Z", "browser_download_url": "https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/releases/download/1.1.1/freecad_source_1.1.1.tar.gz-SHA256.txt"}], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/tarball/1.1.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/zipball/1.1.1", "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Spreadsheet: Don't show overlay by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28017\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] core: fix issue #26478 select all instances even in group with mirror'd objects by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28018\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] measurement: label drag when infront of model by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28019\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Gui: Clear cached shape after change to Deviation by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28024\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Draft: fix clone diffuse color regression by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28025\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] BIM: remove switch to profile beam creation based on dimensions by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28220\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Part: Make 3D View properly checkable by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28031\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Gui: update CoinPtr to not use boost::intrusive_ptr by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28623\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Base: use magnitude for unit schema thresholds by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28589\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Part: Avoid LowerDistanceParameter exception to prevent MacOS crash (\u2026 by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28494\r\n* TechDraw: manual backport of PR#28097 by @WandererFan in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28423\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] PartDesign: fix the range of the custom clearance of threads by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28379\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Sketcher: Fix: Arc of Hyperbola by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28376\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Techdraw: Prevent changing of line style with the extend/shorten tool by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28593\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] CAM: Profile - Fixes _processEachModel() for Compound by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28586\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] The zipios bug has been fixed, do not override the zipios build option for Debian builds. by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28718\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] [Sketcher] Fix missing checkbox preference on loadsettings by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28719\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] fix icns header sizes by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28722\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] BIM: Fix possible code injection attack in FCStd file by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28736\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Build:Remove self-signing code and certs by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28738\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] BIM: restore wall Offset assignment in makeWall by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28750\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Sketcher: enable two-sided lighting for internal faces by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28747\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Sketcher: fix multi-selection highlighting for internal faces by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28748\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Mesh: Use correct bounds for check by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28798\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] PD: When swapping length values, also swap expressions by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28803\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] App: Always use a versioned cache directory by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28802\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] NavLib: Fix DLL import vulnerability by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28799\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Part: fix crash when hovering over internal faces in Projection on Surface by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28805\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Part: Remove invalid edge-count check from taper code by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28806\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Part: make Show Plane unpickable to not block internal face selection by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28808\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] On 32bit archs, E57Format fails to build, misses include to <limits> by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28846\r\n* Build: Fix macOS CFBundleVersion generation by @chennes in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28837\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Allow external PyCXX to be used, and find this external PyCXX via pkgconfig by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28867\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Part: Repect 'VisualTouched' flag even if no geometry changed by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28874\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] BIM: Fix Arch_Schedule ignoring units by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28880\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] BIM: baseless ArchComponent should not lose shape by @Roy-043 in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28895\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] PartDesign: Fix Remove edge button not working in Pipe task panels by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28900\r\n* [Backport releases/FreeCAD-1-1] Security: add module allowlist to PropertyPythonObject::Restore() by @freecad-ci-runner in https://github.com/FreeCAD/